Comment: SFace face recognizer (MobileFaceNet + SFace loss), OpenCV Model Zoo.
 https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_recognition_sface

Files: vendor/*
Copyright: 2000-2025 The OpenCV Foundation, the NumPy developers
License: Apache-2.0
Comment: Unpacked manylinux wheels of opencv-python-headless 4.11.0.86 and
 their bundled private shared libraries. Vendored because Ubuntu 24.04's
 OpenCV 4.6 cannot run the YuNet 2023mar (v2) model, and because PyPI is
 not reachable from the target machine at build time.

